# NFL photo jersey backs (always)

**One silhouette.** Bulky NFL yoke cut with shoulder nameplate, short sleeves with stripe bands, side helmet in frame. Solid `#000` (LED energy). No hanger on photo backs.

**Scale lock:** PNG jersey must fill the frame like the ScammerVille / 49ers reference — **never shrink the jersey** to add collar margin or lift the helmet. CSS uses **width-based** `background-size: 88% auto` (not `auto XX%` height-fit).

**Uniform stack shift:** `--nfl-photo-stack-y` (default `10%`) moves jersey PNG + club wordmark + patron overlays together via `calc()` on `background-position` and overlay `top`. Font caps unchanged (~11.5vh name, ~48vh number).

**Helmet:** Regenerate PNG with **identical jersey scale**; only move the side helmet **up** so it does not touch the right jersey sleeve.

**Wordmark:** baked into the PNG only (club on yoke plate). Upright block caps. CSS hides `.soccer-jersey-team` on photo kits.

**Patron name (CSS):** base `top` ~18% + `var(--nfl-photo-stack-y)` (64×32 base ~16% + shift); `height` ~9%; cap ~11.5vh.

**Number (CSS):** base `top` ~40% + shift (64×32 ~38% + shift); `height` ~28%; cap ~48vh.

**Background:** `background-size: 88% auto`; `background-position: center calc(38% + var(--nfl-photo-stack-y))`.

## GenerateImage prompt (helmet only)

```
CRITICAL: Keep the reference image EXACTLY — same jersey scale, position, size, camera, silhouette. Do NOT shrink or move the jersey body. ONLY move the side helmet UP on the right so there is clear black gap between helmet and right jersey sleeve — helmet must NOT touch the sleeve. Facemask fully visible. Solid #000000. Print ONLY "{CLUB}" on yoke. No patron name/number. No hanger.
```

